ddle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 35 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 54% of normal in September to October and 54% in October to November. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 211% of normal and May to June at 62%. Grid 28665 had its driest year in 1958 at 60% of normal.</p>"}
